<title>FRANCE: ONIC reports free-market wheat, barley, durum bids.</title>
<headline>ONIC reports free-market wheat, barley, durum bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Jan 9 ---		 --- Dec 19 ---</p>
<p>		  Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p>Soft wheat    584,350   11.91-19.93	725,550   7.49-17.44</p>
<p>Barley	  246,000   27.98-31.83	553,000  28.49-32.46</p>
<p>Durum wheat     9,800    5.98-6.98	  23,500   4.44-9.98</p>
<p>Rye		10,000   Not given	    3,000   Not given</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
